        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Photovoltaic cell, multi-Si, at regional storage
Shares of production in Europe (14%) and imports from China (24%) and Asia and Pacific (62%).;
Synonyms: Solarmodul, PV-module, cadmium telluride, thin film; 
UUID: 718d7b2e-4bbf-336a-8fb1-1306cfe9a4e7
Domestic production and imports of multi-crystalline silicon cells used in photovoltaic module production in Europe. Transport from different world regions to regional storage.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: None
Time period: Data refer to 2018
Production volume: na
Sampling: Survey among market intelligence companies 
Extrapolations: None
Uncertainty adjustments: None
